  "description": "Duncan has become bored in his time as a ceremonial duelist for hire. When a charming sorceress employs him for his renown swordsmanship he quickly finds he may have forgotten more of his knightly training than he'd realized. He will aim to redeem himself and rediscover the skill that once earned his great reputation - If his luck lasts that long. It may already be too late as he has become bound to a mysterious relic that may seal his fate forever, The Hand of Brass. Keep up to date with us on Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter @thehandofbrass !",
